Z||000000||Robert||03-24-2000||11:39 PM||||We have got to do something about the reputation our Fiero’s have at the Car-O-Scope site.  Check out my Car-O-Scope and see what I am talking about!<BR> <A HREF="http://cartalk.cars.com/Survey/Results/Psychographics/Caroscopes/237939x4097.html" TARGET=_blank>http://cartalk.cars.com/Survey/Results/Psychographics/Caroscopes/237939x4097.html</A> <P>If we all input how much we care/take care of our cars, it’s got to effect the results of this survey.  I mean really guys, “My dear, it appears that other Pontiac Fiero owners just don't care as much about their cars as you do”, just doesn’t sound like our group.<P>All right now, everyone take the survey.<P>Robert<BR>||||reg||8
Z||000001||Earne||03-25-2000||10:12 AM||||Robert,<P>Who are these people and why do they matter?  I'm going to retire the end of this year (age), the IRS says I'm in the top 2% of wage earners in the country (income), and I have spent a little over twice its value on my Toy (attention to car).  These people would have a field day with me and frankly, I don't need the grief.  I'd rather "talk" to you guys and accept that some of the unenlightened will never understand.<P>Earne (ToyMaker)||||reg||1
